   "snippet": "巽宫：巽 小畜 家人 益 無妄 噬嗑 頤 蠱",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 55,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/jingshi-yizhuan/卷上",
   "snippet": "離宫：離 旅 鼎 未濟 蒙 渙 訟 同人",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 64,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/jingshi-yizhuan/卷上",
   "snippet": "兌宫：兌 困 萃 咸 蹇 謙 小過 歸妹",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 73,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/jingshi-yizhuan/卷上",
   "snippet": "與坤為飛伏，居世。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 75,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/jingshi-yizhuan/卷上",
   "snippet": "與巽為飛伏。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 77,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/jingshi-yizhuan/卷上",
   "snippet": "分北方之卦也，與離為飛伏。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 79,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/jingshi-yizhuan/卷上",
   "snippet": "上艮下艮二象，土木分氣候，與兌為飛伏。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 81,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/jingshi-yizhuan/卷上",
   "snippet": "甲壬配外內二象。象配天，屬金。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 82,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/jingshi-yizhuan/卷上",
   "snippet": "象配天，屬金。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 83,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/jingshi-yizhuan/卷上",
   "snippet": "純陰用事，象配地，屬土。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 85,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/jingshi-yizhuan/卷上",
   "snippet": "水配位為褔德，木入金鄉居寶貝，土臨內象為父母，火來四上嫌相敵，金入金鄉木漸微。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 86,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/jingshi-yizhuan/卷上",
   "snippet": "九三，三公為應。元士居世。大夫居世。諸侯居世。宗廟居世。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 87,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/jingshi-yizhuan/卷上",
   "snippet": "六位純陽，陰象在中。陽極陰生。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 88,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/jingshi-yizhuan/卷上",
   "snippet": "積算起己巳火，至戊辰土，周而復始。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 89,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/jingshi-yizhuan/卷上",
   "snippet": "於類：為馬，為龍。配於人事：為首，為君父。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 91,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/jingshi-yizhuan/卷上",
   "snippet": "配於人事：為腹，為母。于類為馬。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  }
 ]
